{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1444,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad8feb69c7908f8b2a57099e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么了吗？\r\n……这身穿着有什么问题吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c370a02a5d3f037ac18184b44ffbc76ca3f373713f9f78eea45a314379f1318",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84743c8b913a5d34612f6cf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使没预想到会有这样的机会，\r\n我也当然会记住所有的舞步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e2c66888c195121eafddbe6816d78fa5c35a0df132d8cf262ad15c01ab9c2a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e9d79da29fb49295677c59f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了时时追求「胜利」，\r\n我请人用红宝石加以点缀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80058c4a3628584ae635f0196a49bbd428e91df75f5dc5beb797d0b9a3ae364f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:574bfcae1130bab7dbd6b859",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我认为热情是各自拥有不同色彩的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a4caf58013e45a43d1f82bd5604da809d738ecedd660f3b3cceffbd07c77bab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86687f10a10e8944d890ff31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为一族的代表，于此立下坚定不移的决心……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d0dc3f15935622389e59f3cecf12ce065eacd7e805d1649699672f3e7f084dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d82e5ccf387d5842b170fd0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我换好服装了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8de7d97207b2f687fe7d274f01d7b01b6d82c0563fc63db928f60ec5e31b6386",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e2782a3324be8c656fa833c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套服装有什么问题？",
      "source_fingerprint": "126e43141b904edb2376d5b7845893b1bb8cf92287ff51ab9ee00921fb303d54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d8cedb9ccc763d7bd70c057",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即便是私下的时间，  \n所背负之物也不会改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d185b0258afadc3c4cd4411774c849ab6e6fc842d4e93d461ce644983ef90a8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:465ceeb76df11a871944afd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不过于朴素也不过分华丽……  \n应该是适合各种场合的装扮吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36c467783cbdc2387c63539c6f3eae1c4fff973e7658de35381334579637e52b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f049dc3f60fe172daa1b4b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表现出品格的设计……\r\n真不愧是名门特雷森学园。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a18d66765bacdcd4d297538909f57fa1ce735edb07a34d11fadb6b3258d22f1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cac26788669d81f59108f022",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这构造跟设计……让我感受到\r\n设计者为使身着之人能够更加\r\n华丽起舞的那份矜持。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06a27a1f7a5e9f8e22291706dabff59dbe6f43a2eef94ee9bf75b06863e543c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6adfd0df9d11a706525abc3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "视线向前，抬头挺胸。\r\n只要保持应有的姿态向前走就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcc70afa49793d695e647a1d825ee0b4c51c8fbd1f085777f510c642e0838fa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:441998082f50ea709d3dad0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么了吗？\r\n……这身穿着有什么问题吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c370a02a5d3f037ac18184b44ffbc76ca3f373713f9f78eea45a314379f1318",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef28a197ce16742ab74ed8e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使没预想到会有这样的机会，\r\n我也当然会记住所有的舞步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e2c66888c195121eafddbe6816d78fa5c35a0df132d8cf262ad15c01ab9c2a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a130e7a803d1986079541a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了时时追求「胜利」，\r\n我请人用红宝石加以点缀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80058c4a3628584ae635f0196a49bbd428e91df75f5dc5beb797d0b9a3ae364f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:787546c98928a3c419de73a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情熱とは、それぞれの色を持つものと存じます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9f06129f3246f0cb6d34e54ca1657ea6187850c99fa541de67b011f39b0fdb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfa6d46eaa811a96eb5df61a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为一族的代表，于此立下坚定不移的决心……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d0dc3f15935622389e59f3cecf12ce065eacd7e805d1649699672f3e7f084dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3294750980e86b4fd95c4e8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我换好服装了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8de7d97207b2f687fe7d274f01d7b01b6d82c0563fc63db928f60ec5e31b6386",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c3055ea5922fba74f4bf2a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套服装有什么问题？",
      "source_fingerprint": "126e43141b904edb2376d5b7845893b1bb8cf92287ff51ab9ee00921fb303d54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f91417ff941ce9de6edfe12a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a129a3d14e78f675cd247ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论您是谁，我的职责都不会改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c8f1b7ebf697183b1ea3a825b16472f3c2c634eaf3587ab8caed53063ec2d8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95ccbe6fdab986a92e79aaf4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会退让的。\n因为失败是不需要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db7535fb232fe1cd0e1bf2e2c6aa2448897d082b22a2495bd933a3f3710fe8eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f86b2103874844856684614e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候起，为了送忙碌的双亲出门，\r\n我便会配合他们的时间起床。\r\n就算到了今天，我也不需要闹钟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8732603554b0f54ded7922e2cd67bd4f82d2006560617ec395ceb1b08e4c0f66",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9311f06fe233577462e50529",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你看过今天早上的报纸了吗？\r\n上面登了我们家族的报导，\r\n还请你务必一读。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e96af3b0eea52d61e827d2ca98ef53af16c8a332af39f517997228fe3fd9bde5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1fe4b1b00abf395306f833e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我午餐要一个人吃。\r\n如果没有事情要讨论的话，\r\n就不需要坐在一起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66d6baa3f2cc752c9c87128ac2f7bb9f442274e707882403b337602b5991a564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa5655cd8843827eab730c79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休息时间吗？因为我有在上\r\n家庭教师的在线课程，\r\n因此会用来完成外语的作业。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f04c7019705a48105df4127d4ce788fad890769d9f7fae4a34c06d07aad44baa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a70c795bf8981efa2ca9e545",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "关于明天的行程，\r\n由于餐会的时间有所变更，\r\n再麻烦帮我安排追加练习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3642b6298cba005f56d178666dcf24c3d7cacd2f3d1521ab34aba6b174eed68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c16972375e8ffc48bba23e9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡眠不足会影响判断力。\r\n睡不着的时候，请采取\r\n喝花草茶等助眠方法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2336b355ddb80b51c9be23bf1c45d1f55825f403fb88d787c81feddaa5c910ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8afdd204d08ad1143370625",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我春天会见到形形色色的人。\r\n让我留下印象的人，\r\n果然多半都成为了组织的核心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae1afe3c28ae32442a5b5fd3945e1512634185d91cfe48480ab36db4e78f8f21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c2603db1347e84923c6ff10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爱用的阳伞是母亲送我的。\r\n就算在艳阳高照的日子里，\r\n也能够避免出糗，非常方便。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ea7ac096a57989fac434287e5d8f274a7434403c0d600b45861cf2218459c10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe9d7da358ebace69ddbd084",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学园的藏书虽然齐全，\r\n但我家的图书室更是万全。\r\n秋天时我常常沉浸在里面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b31a79b710123f36f2c524e6cb2d18305095b8633fd0e203d5651f9c356cf0bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53018dffda80e394726ad29c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「我的理想工作是即使在寒冬之中，\r\n也能让大家面带笑容迎接新的一年」\r\n……父亲常常这么说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c67531d85c9b589d9a4c7054235e5c1daab2921a04213f4a2d9b84d1e0778ab0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a34cd6bfed7a1388e5b2579a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好。\n今天也一如既往，\n打算履行家族的职责。",
      "source_fingerprint": "656bbf4d1c003bb55eaeb4b6c99b8df62320ee9e98f04a573bf0417df3ac14e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ee928d4fa70cff3cbbf01fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从管家那里收到下个月的日程表了吗？\n确认后，请尽快安排训练计划。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c82b7e259322db0f3075dd5bf950ea4b0c1802378eb9d53f89070e21ddce06c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fd9255b298cc75a089812e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休息时间也是宝贵的学习机会。 \n跳一些轻松的舞蹈的话， 即使是在饭\n后也不会感到负担。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88237949139403f10a8ba145d827a38eacbf6c0a791b031a9aafe1c3437fd2e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb4732a3035f4929e526971f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "营养学我已经学过了。\n因此，学园中的饮食菜单，\n由我亲自管理。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91b3a252f082c38f82d9487a81edcd80d908d3afa661f0dfd01e47704b08cba7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bbc59a1d13df6d8c9a2a387",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜晚的寂静是适合集中精神的环境。  \n让我们为明天做好准备吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6fbe9cd829ce6ba3814e3e24d704d2b6eca3cb04c37e877170dfd550ae98dc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:516f91b8c7a927c39414c35a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "深蓝色的夜空……\n那些星辰的热度，终有一日\n会传达到地面上吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "afaec790338a537471a8f870b2694e043263b5c8922ca39f96d2da5e79132369",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25a95f29e5b18df1403026ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有人把春天视为焕然一新的季节，\n但在我心中，并没有什么可以改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aee915434a2650a53e874c9e9a6fc32e2f155c4722e9d34703056ec10c3b9978",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77f5c07ca4e4da861df47aef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "红宝石有时也被称为太阳之石。\n……那么理所当然地，名字相配的灿烂光辉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba70ff4c8b2ec4f0fdf965300dc5a4379d309222f8b9d585f1d6ed86d6166c1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6c6f3baeec0079c46f965fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "枯叶发出的声音像一首曲子一样，\n对于这种想法，奇迹小姐…却从未这样想过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "665a9898d5dca855ee2693558a1a246fd69076489ca4facefda3c2473ff97ea1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8da54f7dcb14ece0e38a6d5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "青色乍看之下令人联想到冰冷的空气…\n然而，在其中隐藏的热度\n是绝对不会熄灭的火焰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7e840d1cddefb4828aa6e01363fd2414266d8fc5cd4c6ebe3d7df33bbb88285",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce327ade2712adf82d02d9f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节……快乐？",
      "source_fingerprint": "41727f74e5dfe8a539f3767bed7a921050c908c5cf90de7f9f7d5add5a01056a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b757b9a96dddf7720cc66e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节……快乐？",
      "source_fingerprint": "41727f74e5dfe8a539f3767bed7a921050c908c5cf90de7f9f7d5add5a01056a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ff7f5778fbf2531b6c9ba23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很难答应突发性的邀约……\r\n我明明就对太阳\r\n说过好几次了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb476a3f3e94910282ba934d5e2f02204f6506dbdf2fee3a8796e9ac1898be35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0be063b3c898c9244aaaadad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「华丽一族」……当中的成员\r\n都是配得上这名号的高贵人士。\r\n所以我也必须站上巅峰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d24184abec07e6ca9b0ccb072269d41c3d5f42631ed49e26120c1cd9642cf43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5181afeb253c6d2fc86a7db3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "母亲跟奶奶都在比赛中\r\n立下了丰功伟业。要证明\r\n我的血统……就只能靠比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c34ffa449d9f15303483923f685be1678d8f9ad2602acdd78d2745eab59cfd94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b8d826e6fb8589ac63a66be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在常光顾的水果店订货，\r\n寄给爱吃香蕉的奇迹……\r\n好像害她感到很惶恐。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bec87fd75a6a935e6d682a0cd85695906bd7e81d2112f9bd9f54bf9343fb8d55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd4500efa688beb9a99f4dec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老家的莎菲……家里养的狗\r\n非常聪明，它能理解送来的报纸\r\n该递给谁，并且叼过去给他。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73a112f66192d9add9e4c8e0999e812348c518fded25560e7a969349158e2d01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5a67b4ce08eff7f14fd8e7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "服装同时蕴含着符号的功能。\r\n既然有胜者舞台，穿着华丽\r\n成为目光焦点也是必须的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d12bfce4da1aa7c2fdf792f09e301ac48499f5599bd315073db029d83beef542",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d608d8519871d09f59fd775d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家穿相同的服装虽然不稀奇，\r\n但对太阳来说似乎是宝贵的体验。\r\n她还请人帮我们拍照留念。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e123f397ec4549d37522668bded79dd7824eaa1a0020375647e6026c17053333",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eb1bbf09f69830544ad7178",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我挑选的这件衣服\r\n是在品格、机能性以及设计面上，\r\n都符合了标准的最佳解答。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2e611c45d9157f903ab6a3309226c3a1e8dca3ab7d772f01dd63d73c2bc9172",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb3909451509ed146f55709b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "红色蝴蝶结，还有领带……\r\n这颜色中蕴藏了我的决心，\r\n象征着我必定会展现出色的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e404a7f97f32bc58f3a82b8364142462a0f55045b2289f9a4474cd616a06434d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33054628f6845f9cab78cfd7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我早上常常在\r\n校门口看到青竹。\r\n她对工作真是充满热忱呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bca6aab5592110a89151cbdfa9edb0d87cf2f3dee4c1fd4f41801f5dbee1567a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92efb9fdc3deb5986b46e235",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有时候会被问到这个问题，\r\n但要女仆代劳的只有一小部分。\r\n我可以自己顺利完成所有准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a7cbfbd252421468f2ed86660164d2f0f26e8af2b6fa2c06d273a898c57f892",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba5e6cfc28789d957b77da43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在就寝前会诵读家族的金科玉律。\r\n这是我用来反省一天中的言行举止，\r\n是否有辱家族名声的宝贵时间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a40eef3cada38c51480b8f8a008fd05c1856dab1b511c739f338e8ff3e4d397",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aad69db14104f494ea1b0bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天时我会配戴花朵项链。\r\n毕竟符合时令的饰品，\r\n总是能透露出那个人的身份。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9dd0eab1c299ed8fc20551fe1e9e7062841ad9ee35940d5d15698f53a413535",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2380d884a033b26b5c3aa00c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使是在酷暑之中，我也能在\r\n不流一滴汗的情况下完成职责。\r\n这是家族成员都该保持的格调。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc7457562de5d5d9a39ba3edd8983b156476d87e256b00ea64013237920a8e27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bdded38d4f2faa93ffb6179",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才我看到千明将自己整个人\r\n埋在了落叶堆里。她还是一样\r\n是个超出我理解范围的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ca023f523c1323f57f7479aeae4dbc226257b10d868f6f561137475bace0ef4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43185a72e311988d48f68d8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在严寒的早晨里，\r\n奇迹也迟迟无法起床。\r\n……刚睡醒时的声音也有点低沉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ceb0547179c92d4a511587c544007b8d1671e7490f9913feaee2851ab5486ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bae30bf1b6ccbddf07da1d50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我无法理解您所说的大部分内容，\n但太阳神的热情确实让我感受到了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c60e63b6fa2c253c945f36886097b1b4f8dc7a0244bb66f1960c1ea9103d3943",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9a7b9968c088d11ace314a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇迹的话意味深长，  \n似乎能让我有新的发现。也许我和她\n在视角上有什么不同吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6eb650b2adfa0ffde56d380c9c887ef28251e8930f072c29c93ae2dd8a1939ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79b5aba65533065f1199b602",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从青竹身上，我感受到了一种\n贯彻自我正义的信念。\n这值得尊敬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6aef18dad03438dec8942b1bb358f686982fd475a67b27b851c35052948592aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea208058bcfbec0b4e9c65fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "也文小姐习惯用风的名字来比喻事物，\n但只要考虑对话的前后文，\n还是可以推测出其含义的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf37fc2088222087f252b5dc9bc68158d5fad2a44e6c0b2c6378def3cd12b798",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e45e7391349e4cabb912919",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "严于律己，庄重度日。  \n那不过是提升自身的  \n日常生活罢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06de6be629f34c9622425f1377a1321b31e3098bd4902c7824f38e85e9d74009",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe523548f8fa2d9816b60888",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因如此，早晨才更要挺直腰背，\n端正自身姿态。……打哈欠之类\n的行为是绝对不允许的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee20c625679a623042d7f32b6e64cc276a043077622711e4efc60288b36a6eac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b504a2d831703d428ff4398c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无法吃午餐的日子，我会在空闲时间\n吃些轻食来保持平衡。这样一天的营\n养不会有问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87fbdac54738357195e28f8425fbd2da77087d2c3b794f1e61a64c97ba2911c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d760efaa88a77b1dc03c984",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近，我经常做在轻快的音乐中跳舞\n的梦。打算作为形象训练，在现实中\n加以运用。",
      "source_fingerprint": "906ee8f294ea984bb4e9660272a4cd638a99f742168dc8e4e57b365948099ced",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:760fc886e2f6bc35e0e22893",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春风得意，心绪纷乱之事  \n并不存在。在一年的开始，  \n唯有让身心更加紧绷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e0bdcc181a0a80859da1781460f2a1ca0c7cd67ffd089f63b0c869594dc173f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf9aff98b6d04ee3e6962d47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "青梅雨的璀璨光芒，  \n想必能活用于举手投足之间。  \n平日便须时刻铭记于心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f72257927cd5a7e0cfd46fa6e69d7025879e814ffef8a73297e39b573b3cabe9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6896dfa5518ecbb2f5bc91a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了山毛榉装扮的季节，经常会有人\n邀请我去徒步旅行……有时也会作为\n训练的一部分参加。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da5efec0955d92650330ce1fba368878dc6a5d37b0f9f9f84d266ff2ccdd4834",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45bc5965525a8910ec060b80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "连寒夜中的群星也超越的\n光辉，尽归吾身……",
      "source_fingerprint": "40506d4310570fd2d11c9245599f506977d07ef411c2404f259607fc312fdd01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6482ea3c1b4d2bd58d8c31fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『服装』也是自己的武器。  \n我会根据情况，选择最合适的  \n装备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2676529097b18d38618a57931af4849e912f9d2c50f9d2c3d2dfd28e41817f5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90a511ae5b1518ef59b4d374",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "设计方面是由我亲自完成的。  \n关于时尚的事情，  \n也是社交中必备的教养呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12264367a5469c9500ce13dc63ab7c28b095ae3408de3fc47d0cafcdc8b30a60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0ac241f9e8c7b5dc2267601",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也要请你多多指教了。\r\n在我达到与家族相称的基准前，\r\n还请彻底指导我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6392f6ce21c5d249b8a52af859de5ccd269b5323f6dabb2f3aebc8030debe7f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e39f5b6ebbc4f0ccf1f6bdc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "参上",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a1281566a536eb899dc047da232a71e4e151e0779da98a3707fbcb3e07f82b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fc5b5c6b09a407322073482",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若要继承各位的威望，则必须付出\r\n比非凡水平……更甚的努力才行。\r\n以目前的体况而言，也将能够达成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a50e0ce923c1e4fa0661d2d5e619cfbd42d97cf0dd8bdaba2d24661babf926b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03e100ab37881a8077f29a12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想你应当确认过\r\n运动医学会的最新发表了。\r\n我们之后再来讨论吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f95af5511b7e290450e36a26c0ba84ce7cca2a5b2d060caf93e86dbbf7c77e8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc8ccf05ed8684aaa1eb3006",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有些职责只能在比赛中完成。\r\n既然清楚己身的目的，\r\n就无须迷惘，只管向前迈进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec3b7b01d2114c9696b08788cc17130e5932fbeb055dc6d95373566cd482cbd2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aed4ff8ec5ae7dd0b48d1b26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然成了我的训练员，\r\n你应该做好觉悟了。\r\n请尽情发挥能力，别留下遗憾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fe3f5b6bfd0b445f4982598bc0da2150047a2e95a37a6e6289f4c37c9935aa0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1085",
        "92005"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
